The reference data in data/ is compiled from public Indonesian regulations and
official announcements, and is distributed under the same MIT License as the
code. It is not an official publication of any government agency. The exact
documents, retrieval dates, and checksums for every dataset are listed in
data/manifest.json.

Regions (data/regions.csv)
  Keputusan Menteri Dalam Negeri Nomor 300.2.2-2138 Tahun 2025 as amended by
  Nomor 300.2.2-2430 Tahun 2025. Names were normalized with the help of
  cahyadsn/wilayah (https://github.com/cahyadsn/wilayah), Copyright (c) 2025
  cahya dsn, MIT License, and checked code by code against the decree.

Historical region codes (data/region_aliases.csv)
  Undang-Undang Nomor 14, 15, 16, and 29 Tahun 2022 (Papua provinces),
  Undang-Undang Nomor 20 Tahun 2012 (Kalimantan Utara), and Peraturan Menteri
  Dalam Negeri Nomor 66 Tahun 2011 for the codes used before 2012.

Vehicle plate codes (data/plate_codes.csv)
  Lampiran Peraturan Kepolisian Negara Republik Indonesia Nomor 7 Tahun 2021,
  with the 2024 codes for Papua Barat Daya, Papua Selatan, Papua Tengah, and
  Papua Pegunungan as announced by Korlantas Polri and the provincial
  governments. Regencies the regulation does not list are assigned the code of
  their parent regency or the only code of their province, marked "(induk)".

Fixed-line area codes (data/area_codes.csv)
  Lampiran Peraturan Menteri Komunikasi dan Informatika Nomor 14 Tahun 2018,
  Tabel II.2 to II.8. Each place named in the tables is mapped to the regency
  or city that contains it; four places that could not be located with
  confidence are left out.
